<figure class="project-figure review-method">
  <div class="method-flow">
    <div class="method-step">
      <span class="method-number">1</span>
      <h3>Predict relevance</h3>
      <p>
        A frozen model reads the query, product title, brand and color through 17 lexical features.
      </p>
      <p class="method-result">
